          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a result…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待结果…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working directories for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的工作目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report changed while being read. Choose it again to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取期间报告发生了变化。请重新选择后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog contains unsupported fields. Its original data was preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录包含不支持的字段，原始数据已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog contains conflicting or invalid projects. Its original data was preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录包含冲突或无效的项目，原始数据已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog could not be read. Recover the original file before saving changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取项目目录。请先恢复原始文件，再保存更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog changed outside this window. Changes are temporary; reopen MoeKit to reload the saved catalog.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录已在此窗口之外更改。当前更改仅临时保留；请重新打开 MoeKit 以重新载入已保存的目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project catalog exceeds the 16 MB limit. Changes were not saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录超过 16 MB 限制，更改未保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a project folder or discover Git repositories in folders you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一个项目文件夹，或在指定位置发现 Git 仓库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After discovery, Tasks shows progress, cancellation and actual results. Git working-tree changes are not checked yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现任务的进度、取消状态和实际结果会显示在「任务」中。目前还不检查 Git 工作区的修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始前先了解"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Add project for one folder, or Discover in folder to find Git repositories and review what to import. Only selected folders are read; no project files are changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用「添加项目」选择单个文件夹，或用「在文件夹中发现」查找 Git 仓库并复查要导入的项目。只读取所选文件夹，不修改项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Import report to open an existing Mole analyze --json file. MoeKit reads only that file; it does not run Mole or scan the paths in the report. Report sizes are not reclaimable space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击「导入报告」打开已有的 Mole analyze --json 文件。MoeKit 只读取该文件，不运行 Mole，也不扫描报告中的路径。报告大小不等于可回收空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Start scan in the toolbar to read current-user executable names and paths, working directories and TCP listening endpoints. No command arguments, environment variables or process signals. Nothing is scanned automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击工具栏的「开始扫描」，读取当前用户的可执行文件名称和路径、工作目录、TCP 监听地址与端口。不读取命令参数或环境变量，不发送进程信号，也不会自动扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a first step and learn what this preview can read and do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择第一步，了解当前预览能读取什么、能做什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo uses built-in examples. Entering Demo does not scan folders or processes, import reports, or replace your saved projects. Processes & Ports has no Demo scan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "示例模式使用内置数据。进入时不会扫描文件夹或进程、导入报告，也不会替换已保存的项目。「进程与端口」没有示例扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explore Projects, Tools and Tasks. The Demo banner stays visible; use Exit demo whenever you want to return to your own data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览「项目」「工具」和「任务」。示例模式会一直显示提示；随时点「退出示例」返回自己的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find your current user’s processes and TCP listening ports with a read-only snapshot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过只读快照，查看当前用户的进程和 TCP 监听端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Getting started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上手引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Getting started…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上手引导…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Processes & Ports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往进程与端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Projects": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Processes & Ports, choose Start scan when you’re ready. Select a row to see its identity, ports and project-association evidence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进入「进程与端口」后，准备好再点「开始扫描」。选择一行即可查看进程身份、端口和项目关联依据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Projects, choose Add project for one folder, or Discover in folder to find Git repositories. Review discovery results before importing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进入「项目」后，用「添加项目」选择单个文件夹，或用「在文件夹中发现」查找 Git 仓库。发现后先复查，再导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look around with examples": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先看看示例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole Space can import an existing JSON report. This preview cannot run CLI tools, clean files, uninstall apps or stop processes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 的「空间」可导入已有 JSON 报告。当前预览还不能运行 CLI 工具、清理文件、卸载应用或停止进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open getting started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开上手引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Organize my projects": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理我的项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上手引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading starts only after you choose a folder. Discovery is bounded and read-only. Project paths, names and pins are saved locally; project files are not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有选定文件夹后才开始读取。发现范围有限且只读；项目路径、名称和置顶信息保存在本机，不修改项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See processes and ports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看进程与端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时跳过"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This button opens the workspace. It does not start a scan or ask for folder access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下面的按钮只打开对应页面，不会开始扫描或请求文件夹访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try example projects, task results and a Mole report before using your own data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先体验示例项目、任务结果和 Mole 报告，再使用自己的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to MoeKit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 MoeKit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would you like to do first?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想先做什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can reopen this guide from Help or Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之后可从「帮助」或「设置」重新打开引导。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first step": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一步怎么做"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your projects, tools and task results, together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把项目、工具和任务结果放在一起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A snapshot is read only when you choose Start scan or Refresh: current-user executable names and paths, working directories, and TCP listening endpoints. Command arguments and environment variables are not read. No process signals are sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有点击「开始扫描」或「刷新」才读取快照：当前用户的可执行文件名称和路径、工作目录、TCP 监听地址与端口。不读取命令参数或环境变量，不向进程发送信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected folders could not be read. Choose accessible folders and try again. No files were changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取所选文件夹。请选择可访问的文件夹后重试。未更改任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes could not be saved. They are temporary; check available disk space and folder access, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存更改，目前仅临时保留。请检查可用磁盘空间和文件夹访问权限后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file is not a supported Mole JSON report. Export a new analyze --json report and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件不是受支持的 Mole JSON 报告。请重新导出 analyze --json 报告后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be read. Check access to the selected file and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取报告。请检查所选文件的访问权限后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode uses example projects and results. Changing modes cancels current discovery and report imports. It never starts a process or changes project files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo 模式使用示例项目和结果。切换模式会取消当前的项目发现和报告导入，不会启动进程或更改项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another MoeKit window is saving the catalog. Changes are temporary; try saving again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一个 MoeKit 窗口正在保存项目目录。当前更改仅临时保留，请再次保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog lock is not a private regular file. Changes were not saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录锁不是仅当前用户可访问的普通文件，更改未保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A regular file has executable permission bits. Its contents, tool identity and version have not been checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到带可执行权限位的普通文件，但未检查内容、工具身份或版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A symbolic link exists. Its target, tool identity and version have not been checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到符号链接，但未检查其目标、工具身份或版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelling inspection…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在取消检查…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check common locations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查常见位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check file locations and find official installation instructions. Finding a file does not verify a working or trusted tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查文件位置并查看官方安装说明。找到文件并不代表工具可用或可信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a candidate file to inspect its metadata. It will not be run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择候选文件以检查其元数据，不会运行该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a local, absolute file path without invalid characters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择不含无效字符的本地绝对文件路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copying only changes the clipboard. Running this command yourself can install dependencies, access the network and update Homebrew. Review the official instructions first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制仅更新剪贴板。你自行运行此命令可能安装依赖、访问网络并更新 Homebrew，请先查看官方说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not inspect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found · unverified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已找到 · 未验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you already use Homebrew, its documented install command is:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你已在使用 Homebrew，官方文档中的安装命令为："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect another file…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查其他文件…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect metadata": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查元数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspecting file metadata…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查文件元数据…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install or review manually": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手动安装或查看说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location checks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locations checked by this button": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此按钮检查的位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Metadata could not be read. This does not mean the tool is missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取元数据，这不代表工具不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole execution remains unavailable. Space can import a JSON report without installing or running Mole. No cleanup command is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 执行尚未接入。空间页面无需安装或运行 Mole 即可导入 JSON 报告。清理命令尚未连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not found at this path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此路径未找到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Official installation instructions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方安装说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only metadata is inspected. No version command, shell, installer or tool is started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅读取文件元数据，不运行版本命令、Shell、安装程序或工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other installation locations have not been checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未检查其他安装位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Project discovery reads Git metadata without running Git. A file at /usr/bin/git may be an Apple launcher; it does not prove Command Line Tools are installed. Git status execution remains unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目发现直接读取 Git 元数据，不运行 Git。/usr/bin/git 可能是 Apple 启动器，存在此文件不代表已安装命令行工具。Git 状态执行尚未接入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The inspection did not finish. No tool was run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查未完成，没有运行任何工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This location is not a regular file or a symbolic link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此位置不是普通文件或符号链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This regular file has no executable permission bits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此普通文件没有可执行权限位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool inspection is disabled in Demo. No example installation is shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "示例模式下不检查工具，也不会展示虚构的安装结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool preparation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具准备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool preparation…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具准备…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsupported candidate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持的候选文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld entries · empty rows do not prove an empty disk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个条目 · 空列表不代表磁盘为空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis cancelled. No new report was accepted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析已取消。未接收新的报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis exceeded its output limit and was stopped. No complete report is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析输出超出限制，已停止。没有可用的完整报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis reached its time limit and was stopped. No complete report is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析达到时间限制，已停止。没有可用的完整报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis stopped, but private-session cleanup could not be verified. No user folder was deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析已停止，但无法确认私有会话清理情况。未删除用户文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyze with Mole": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Mole 分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyze with Mole…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Mole 分析…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzing selected folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在分析所选文件夹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an existing local folder and the direct installed Mole analyzer. Root, symbolic links and overlapping private-session paths are unsupported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择现有本地文件夹和已安装的直接 Mole 分析器。暂不支持根目录、符号链接及与私有会话重叠的路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose analyze-go from Mole’s official release installation. Homebrew and custom-built analyzers are not supported by this version check. MoeKit does not install or update tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择 Mole 官方发布安装中的 analyze-go。此版本校验暂不支持 Homebrew 或自行构建的分析器。MoeKit 不会安装或更新工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose one folder for a separately confirmed Mole analysis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择一个文件夹；开始 Mole 分析前还会单独确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the installed direct analyzer (analyze-go), not the mo shell wrapper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择已安装的直接分析器 analyze-go，不要选择 mo shell 包装脚本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm folder analysis": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认文件夹分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder to analyze": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待分析文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed analyzer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装的分析器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Mole result · filtered, non-atomic observation · no cleanup action": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 实际分析结果 · 按上游规则筛选的非原子观察 · 不执行清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit could not establish its private analysis directory. No analysis was started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 无法建立私有分析目录。未开始分析。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit will create a verified temporary analyzer copy and a fresh private cache/temp directory below the location shown here, then remove only that session after the process stops. Your existing Mole cache is not used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 会在下方位置创建已校验的临时分析器副本及新的私有缓存和临时目录，进程停止后仅移除本次会话。不会使用你现有的 Mole 缓存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole runs with your normal user permissions, without an OS sandbox. The reviewed analysis command does not delete or change selected-folder content; incidental metadata reads may extend beyond it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 将使用你的普通用户权限运行，没有操作系统沙箱。已审查的分析命令不会删除或更改所选文件夹内容；附带的元数据读取可能超出该目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No live analysis result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚无实时分析结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only confirmed analysis with a verified official analyzer is connected. Cleanup and other Mole commands are unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅接入使用已验证官方分析器、逐次确认的分析功能。清理及其他 Mole 命令不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review analysis…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查分析计划…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the verified official Mole V1.57.0 analyzer on one folder after reviewing the scope. Cleanup remains unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核对范围后，使用已验证的 Mole V1.57.0 官方分析器分析一个文件夹。清理功能仍不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selections do not start a process. Review the plan, then explicitly start analysis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择文件不会启动进程。请先复查计划，再明确开始分析。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start analysis": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping analysis…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在停止分析…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analysis could not finish. No new report was accepted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析未能完成。未接收新的报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analyzer exited unsuccessfully or reached a resource limit. No complete report is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析器异常退出或达到资源限制。没有可用的完整报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bundled analysis supervisor is unavailable. Reinstall a verified MoeKit build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随应用提供的分析管理程序不可用。请重新安装经过验证的 MoeKit 版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The live report does not identify its scan coverage. It was rejected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时报告未说明扫描覆盖情况。已拒绝该报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report contained paths outside the selected scope, or paths changed during validation. It was rejected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告包含所选范围以外的路径，或路径在校验期间发生变化。已拒绝该报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected folder or analyzer changed. Choose them again and review a new analysis plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件夹或分析器已变化。请重新选择并复查新的分析计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file does not match the supported official Mole V1.57.0 analyzer for this Mac. No tool was run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件与本机受支持的 Mole V1.57.0 官方分析器不匹配。未运行任何工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verifying analyzer…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在校验分析器…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS quarantine is present on this analyzer. MoeKit will not remove it or bypass Gatekeeper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此分析器带有 macOS 隔离标记。MoeKit 不会移除标记或绕过 Gatekeeper。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mole command is not connected. Only separately confirmed analysis is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mole 命令尚未接入。目前仅提供单独确认后的分析功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole returned an invalid or inconsistent report. No new report was accepted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 返回的报告无效或存在矛盾。未接收新的报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzer limits: 120 seconds elapsed, 60 CPU seconds per process, 16 MB report and 64 KB diagnostics. Reports may be partial; sizes are not reclaimable space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析器限制：总用时 120 秒、每个进程 CPU 时间 60 秒、报告 16 MB、诊断 64 KB。报告可能不完整；显示大小不等于可回收空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
